  "correct": "1",
  "solution": "**Formula used:**\n\na² - b² = (a + b)(a - b)\n\n**Calculation**\n\n⇒ (p²-(q-r)²)/((p+r)²-q²)+(q²-(p-r)²)/((p+q)²-r²)+(r²-(p-q)²)/((q+r)²-p²)\n\n⇒ [(p + q - r)(p - q + r)]/[(p + q + r)(p - q + r)] + [(p + q - r)(q - p + r)]/[(p + q + r)(p + q - r)] + [(p - q + r)(q -p + r)]/[(p + q + r)(q - p + r)]\n\n⇒ [(p + q - r)]/[(p + q + r)] + [q - p + r)]/[(p + q + r)] + [(p - q + r)]/[(p + q + r)]\n\n⇒ [(p + q - r)]/[(p + q + r)] + [q - p + r)]/[(p + q + r)] + [(p - q + r)]/[(p + q + r)]\n\n⇒ (p + q + r)/(p + q + r)\n\n⇒ 1.\n\n**The value is 1.**\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/ca81259519cadfb2d5350673c220e419e60378e9770ad26512fc8e826a8d93f1.png] **__Shortcut Trick__**\n\nLet put p = q = r = 1\n\nSo,\n\n(p²-(q-r)²)/((p+r)²-q²)+(q²-(p-r)²)/((p+q)²-r²)+(r²-(p-q)²)/((q+r)²-p²)\n\n⇒ (1²-(1-1)²)/((1+1)²-1²)+(1²-(1-1)²)/((1+1)²-1²)+(1²-(1-1)²)/((1+1)²-1²)\n\n⇒ (1-0)/((4-1))+(1-0)/((4-1))+(1-0)/((4-1))\n\n⇒ 1/3 + 1/3 + 1/3 = 1\n\n**Hence, The value is 1.**",
